			"date": "2023-06-12T19:24:59.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Hoping for “BADLY” 🤞</p><p>But probably won’t make a difference. Why, do you think it would? </p><p>A lot of developers are still “Don’t tar us all with the same brush, some of us only use React because we need to get paid!” …when they actively chose to take that route in the first place because “React Developer” was where the big money jobs were. Selling out your clients and users requires a financial *and* moral decision, who knew?</p>",
